        "comment": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6531#section-3.3 atext =/ UTF8-non-ascii; https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3629#section-4 UTF8-3 admits U+FFFF",
        "data": "￿@example.com",
        "valid": true
      }
    ]
